5.0 MITIGATION MEASURES
5.1 Pre-Deployment Requirements
Environmental Screening: GIS overlay for protected areas, water bodies, sensitive species

Weather Conditions: Wind <15 mph, no precipitation within 6 hours, temperature <35°C

Seasonal Restrictions: No deployment during peak breeding seasons (species-specific)

Cultural Resource Protection: 500m buffer from archaeological sites

