5.3 Post-Deployment Monitoring
Water Quality Sampling: Downstream monitoring if within 500m of water

Vegetation Surveys: 7-day and 30-day post-application assessments

Soil Testing: pH and conductivity at 1, 7, 30 days

Wildlife Observation: Document behavior changes within impact zone

5.4 Spill/Accident Response Plan
Containment: Absorbent berms for liquid components

Collection: Manual removal of shell fragments

Soil Remediation: Light tilling to accelerate biodegradation

Water Protection: Activated carbon barriers if near water

Reporting: Immediate notification to regulatory agencies

